    {
      "en": "label halloweenfive13:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty1.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "To the {i}real home.{/i}",
      "zh": "回到{i}真正的家。{/i}"
    },
    {
      "en": "But Axelrod Adamson stayed tied to a chair.",
      "zh": "但 Axelrod Adamson 依旧被绑在椅子上。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t know! Maybe your voice just has some kind of reverse effect on my ears? Or maybe I just understand everything you’re going to say before you even say it?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ": 我不知道！也许你的声音对我的耳朵有什么反效果？或者我只是能在你说出口之前就明白你要说什么？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty2.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ooh! Maybe I have {i}Sana-vision?!{/i} That sounds like a cool power — always being able to see what {i}you{/i} think or mean! Barring all of that stuff you said about wanting to be raped in an alley, of course.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ": 哦！也许我有 {i}Sana 视觉？！{/i}听起来是个超酷的能力——永远能看见{i}你{/i}在想什么、想表达什么！当然，除了你说的那些想在巷子里被强奸的话之外。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I thought we...weren’t going to talk about that again?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ": 我以为我们……说好不再提那件事了？……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just to other people. We can still discuss our crazy fetishes with each other.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ": 只是不跟别人提而已。我们俩之间还是可以讨论彼此的疯狂癖好的。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": What the fuck is this?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 这他妈是什么情况？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty3.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, hey Makoto! Did you hear that? Sana and I were just talking about the time Nodoka tricked us into having a friend-orgy thing. But, since you were there-",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ": 哦，嗨 Makoto！你听到了吗？我和 Sana 刚在聊 Nodoka 骗我们搞朋友群交那次的事。不过，既然你当时也在——"
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, I mean what the fuck {i}is this?!{/i}",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 不，我是说这他妈{i}到底是什么？！{/i}"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think it’s called a...party?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ": 我觉得这个……叫派对？……"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty4.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No! I...I went back to the past! And then there was a...me without a face...and a clown! And now I’m back here?! How?!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 不！我……我回到过去了！然后那里有个……没有脸的我……还有个小丑！现在我又回到了这里？！怎么会？！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uh-oh...Makoto caught the Sensei disease where her...memories are always weird and wrong...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ": 啊哦……Makoto 染上了 Sensei 那种病，她的……记忆总是又怪又错……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Joking aside, do you need to go outside for a minute? Sounds to me like you might be having a-",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ": 玩笑归玩笑，你要不要出去待一会儿？听起来你可能是要——"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty5.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m fine! Just...tell me where Sensei is! I need to talk to him!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 我没事！就……告诉我 Sensei 在哪！我得跟他谈谈！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei? He just left with that extremely creepy yet oddly lovable child who was here just a minute ago. Were you zoning out for the whole scene?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ": Sensei？他刚跟那个极其诡异却又莫名讨人喜欢的小孩走了，一分钟前还在这儿来着。你整段都在走神吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": You might...still be able to catch him if you...run?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ": 如果你……跑去追的话……说不定还赶得上？……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": You could always use your phone too. It’s not like we’re trapped in some dated movie where every time there’s drama that needs to be resolved, the characters suddenly can’t get into contact with one another.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ": 你也可以用手机啊。我们又不是被困在什么老套电影里，每次一有需要化解的戏剧冲突，角色们就突然联系不上彼此了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty6.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Cool, thanks! Bye!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 好，谢了！再见！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I feel like...what you just said...might be a little too on the nose given that...it’s probably going to happen now...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ": 我觉得……你刚才说的那番话……可能戳得太准了，因为……它大概马上就要应验了……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or at least it {i}was{/i} going to happen. But the fact that you openly acknowledged it adds another dimension where it’s now {i}expected{/i} to go like that. Which means it won’t.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ": 或者说{i}本来是{/i}要发生的。可你公开点破了这一点，就又多了一层维度——现在大家都{i}预期{/i}它会那样发展。也就是说，它不会了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": So what happens if I...agree and...the two of us...land on the same conclusion?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ": 那如果我也……同意，然后我们两个……得出同样的结论呢？……"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty7.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not sure. But if {i}I{/i} were a director, I’d seize that opportunity to cut back to the main character and abruptly fade out our-",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ": 我不确定。但如果{i}我{/i}是导演，我会抓住这个机会切回主角，然后突然把我们的画面淡出——"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Come on, come on, come on!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 快点，快点，快点！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’re sorry. Your call can not be completed as dialed. Please hang up and-",
      "spk": "Voice On Phone",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 抱歉，您的呼叫无法接通。请挂断后——"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty8.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fuck! Are you serious right now?! I can’t run in this costume! It’s way too tight!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 操！你他妈在逗我？！穿这身衣服我跑不了！太紧了！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...and then we’d cut right back in as soon as another segue is needed!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ": ……然后一旦需要下一个转场，我们就会被立刻切回来！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...look...Ami and Maya finally made it...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ": 哦……你看……Ami 和 Maya 终于来了……"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty9.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I see that Ayane’s taste in decor is just as odd and thematically confused as always. At least I can take comfort in that while I’m watching the man I love put his penis inside of my best friend.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ": 嗯，看来 Ayane 的装饰品味还是一如既往地古怪又主题混乱。至少在我看着我爱的男人把阴茎插进我最好的朋友体内时，还能靠这个找点安慰。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ll keep me company even if things go horribly, right? Because I’m not exactly liked around here anymore and I won’t be able to stop anybody if they all try to jump me and take my things.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ": 就算事情变得很糟，你也会陪着我的，对吧？因为这里的人已经不怎么喜欢我了，要是他们一起上来扑我、抢我的东西，我可拦不住。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty10.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Give me your phone right now!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 马上把你的手机给我！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ahh! It’s already happening!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ": 啊！这就已经开始了！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why am I being touched?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ": 为什么要碰我？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because Sensei just disappeared with a small child and I need to act right now before anything happens to him!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 因为 Sensei 刚跟一个小孩子消失了，我得在他出事之前立刻行动！"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty11.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Should we...not be more worried about the small child?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ": 我们难道……不该更担心那个小孩子吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": What small child? It wasn’t Nao-chan, was it? Because me and Maya just came in through the main entrance and didn’t see either one of them.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ": 什么小孩子？该不会是 Nao 酱吧？因为我和 Maya 刚从正门进来，没看见他们俩任何一个。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": It might also help to know where they’re going. Ami and I sort of need Sensei to be here in order to complete our mission.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ": 知道他们要去哪儿也有帮助。我和 Ami 需要 Sensei 留在这儿，才能完成我们的任务。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t care about your mission, just give me your phone. I already tried calling him from mine but I couldn’t get through.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 我不管你们的任务，把手机给我就行。我已经用我的打过了，打不通。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty12.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure, yeah. I can  put aside my unending hate for you if it means helping Sensei. You {i}do{/i} seem really worried, so...I’m going to trust you here, Makoto. Don’t let me down.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ": 行吧，可以。如果能帮到 Sensei，我可以把对你无止境的仇恨放到一边。你看起来{i}真的{/i}很着急，所以……这次我选择相信你，Makoto。别让我失望。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure. Yeah. Phone.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 好。行。手机。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": What happens if he’s just...not here for the rest of the night? Because the entire reason I even came to this thing in the first place was try and “drag him back.”",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ": 如果他整晚都……不在这儿怎么办？因为我来参加这玩意的唯一理由，就是想把他“拖回去”。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty13.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m aggressive Maya right now. I don’t have time to waste mingling with 95%% of my enemies while the one man I have ever cared about fucks his childhood friend {i}and{/i} “Nao-chan” at the same time.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ": 我现在是攻击型的 Maya。我没工夫浪费在跟 95%% 的敌人应酬上，而我这辈子唯一在乎过的男人，正同时操着他的青梅竹马{i}和{/i}“Nao 酱”。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": If he’s not here, we can leave. You, me, and Makoto can split up and look for him. But this just means we’re probably going to have to turn the threesome into a foursome to pay her back for her hard work.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ": 如果他不在这儿，我们就走。你、我，还有 Makoto 分头去找他。但这大概意味着我们得把三人行变成四人行，好报答她的辛苦付出。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty14.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ugh. I can only allow so many more people into this affair before I have to start questioning my logic in just what I’m willing to do to pursue him.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ": 呃。在我开始质疑自己为了追他到底愿意做到什么地步之前，我能容忍挤进这件事的人已经不多了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": What the fuck are you guys even-",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 你们俩到底在说什——"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty15.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’re sorry. Your call can not be completed as dialed. Please hang up and-",
      "spk": "Voice On Phone",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 抱歉，您的呼叫无法接通。请挂断后——"
    },
    {
      "en": ": FUCKING HELL!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 操他妈的！"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Take your stupid phone back! I’ll just figure something else out! I’ll- Ayane! Right! Maybe she got sent back too?!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 把你那破手机拿回去！我自己想办法！我——Ayane！对啊！也许她也被送回去了？！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sent back to where?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ": 送回哪儿去？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": If he’s not here, we can leave. You, me, and Makoto can split up and look for him. But this just means we’re probably going to have to turn the threesome into a foursome to pay her back for her hard work.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ": 如果他不在这儿，我们就走。你、我，还有 Makoto 分头去找他。但这大概意味着我们得把三人行变成四人行，好报答她的辛苦付出。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? Didn’t you already say that?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ": 什么？你不是说过了吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty16.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ayane!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": Ayane！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not right now, Makoto. I’m brooding over the fact that I just lost to a little girl.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ": 现在不行，Makoto。我正在为一个事实闷闷不乐——我居然输给了一个小女孩。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Brood later! Has anything weird happened to you over the last few minutes?!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 待会儿再闷！过去几分钟里你身上有没有发生什么奇怪的事？！"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty17.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did I mention the fact that I just lost to a little girl? If I can’t win him over in a red leather suit, when {i}can{/i} I, Makoto? This is getting ridiculous.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ": 我刚说我输给了一个小女孩，你听见没有？如果穿一身红色皮衣都赢不了他，我还{i}能{/i}在什么时候赢，Makoto？这太荒唐了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": {i}Weirder!{/i} Like, reset-adjacent weird! Because I’m pretty sure I just went through one!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": {i}更怪的！{/i}像是跟重置有关的怪事！因为我很确定我刚刚就经历了一次！"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty18.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, what? But we were talking about slumber parties like five minutes ago. How is that even possible?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ": 等等，什么？可我们五分钟前还在聊睡衣派对啊。这怎么可能？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t know! I...I mean...maybe that’s not what it was! But I went back to the first Halloween and...everything was different.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 我不知道！我……我是说……也许那不是重置！但我回到了第一个万圣节，然后……一切都变了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty19.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Different {i}how?...{/i}",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ": {i}怎么个不同法？……{/i}"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just...everything. Ami was Sensei’s actual daughter and her mom never died. {i}You{/i} never started sleeping with him. And also, I may have had a threesome while I was there. But that’s beside the point!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 就是……一切。Ami 是 Sensei 的亲生女儿，她妈妈也没有死。{i}你{/i}从来没有跟他上过床。还有，我在那儿的时候可能搞了个三人行。不过那不重要！"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty20.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then why would you even bring it up?!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ": 那你提它干嘛？！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t know! It’s not like it was a goal of mine! I just got pressured into it! And it only happened because {i}Sensei{/i} was there too!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 我不知道！那又不是我的目标！我只是被推着就……而且会发生，也是因为 {i}Sensei{/i} 当时也在场！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I’d sure hope so! Because if you just had a threesome with two of our classmates, I’d really start to question your feelings for him!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ": 哼，我当然希望是这样！因为如果你刚跟两个同班同学搞了三人行，我可真要怀疑你对他的感情了！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, no, no! {i}Our{/i} Sensei! He went back {i}with{/i} me!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 不不不！是{i}我们的{/i} Sensei！他{i}跟我{/i}一起回去了！"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty19.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He...what?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ": 他……什么？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah! But then some weird shit happened to me and {i}I{/i} got pulled back here. But I don’t know if {i}he{/i} did too since I can’t get through to him.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 对！但后来我身上发生了些怪事，就被拉回这里了。我不知道{i}他{/i}是不是也回来了，因为我联系不上他。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": And if he’s {i}not himself{/i} right now and we really {i}are{/i} rapidly spiraling into another reset out of nowhere, I’m worried he might stay gone for good.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 如果他现在{i}不是他自己{/i}，而我们真的{i}在{/i}毫无征兆地急速坠入又一次重置，我怕他会就这么永远消失。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty21",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty21.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty21"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I knew it...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ": 我就知道……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Ayane?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": ……Ayane？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I knew something was wrong...I felt it...But he just kept saying he needed to go and...I just let it happen...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ": 我就知道哪里不对……我感觉到了……可他只是一直说他得走，然后……我就这么让他走了……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I should’ve kept him here...I should have grabbed his arm and held on like both of our lives depended on it...but I just let him go...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ": 我该把他留下的……我该抓住他的胳膊死死不放，就像我们俩的命都悬在上面一样……可我就那么让他走了……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Y...Yes. But we don’t know for sure that this is actually happening yet! Which is why we need to find him and {i}then{/i} hold onto him. There’s no time to feel sorry for ourselves right now.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 是……是啊。可我们还不能确定这事真的在发生！所以我们得找到他，{i}然后{/i}抓住他不放。现在没时间自怨自艾。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ": ……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ayane...",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": Ayane……"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty22",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty22.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty22"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re right! Playtime’s over! I can feel sorry for myself {i}after{/i} we track down our teacher! ",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ": 你说得对！玩闹时间结束了！{i}等{/i}我们把老师找回来，我再自怨自艾也不迟！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow, you really don’t let yourself wallow in misery for long at all, do you?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 哇，你真的完全不会在痛苦里沉溺太久啊？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nope! It’s both my greatest strength and biggest weakness! But that’s beside the point! The first thing we need to do is try and figure out where he went. You said you already tried calling him, right?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ": 不会！这既是我最大的优点，也是最大的缺点！不过那不重要！我们首先要做的是搞清楚他去了哪儿。你说你打过电话了，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty23",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty23.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty23"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve tried from two separate phones — which leads me to believe that there is some external source preventing us from digitally contacting him.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 我用两部不同的手机都试过了——这让我觉得有某种外部力量在阻止我们用电子方式联系到他。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or the service is just really bad over here. You’re connected to the WiFi, right? The password is Geoffrey1.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ": 或者就是这边信号太差。你连上 WiFi 了吧？密码是 Geoffrey1。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m already connected. But I can try calling again once we’re a little further away from the mansion if you think it’ll work. Also, Ami and Maya just showed up and I think they’re going to help us too.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 我已经连上了。不过如果你觉得有用，等我们离宅子远一点，我可以再打一次。还有，Ami 和 Maya 刚到，我觉得她们也会帮忙。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Great. Now, we just have to figure out where to look.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ": 很好。现在，我们只需要搞清楚该去哪儿找。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": And thanks for finally taking some initiative, Makoto. I have a really good feeling about this if {i}both{/i} of us are going to be doing our best.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ": 还有，谢谢你终于主动了一回，Makoto。如果{i}我们俩{/i}都全力以赴，我有种很好的预感。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thank me later. I’ve got a good feeling too.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": 以后再谢我吧。我也有好预感。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene backtotherightparty24",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty24.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty24"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": ……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ayane?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ": Ayane？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
