      "en": "scene backtotherightparty25",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/backtotherightparty25.webp",
      "alt": "backtotherightparty25"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, where’d Ayane go? Weren’t the two of you just-",
      "spk": "Imani",
      "spkColor": "#80C9DC",
      "zh": ": 嘿，Ayane 去哪儿了？你们俩刚才不是还——"
