    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What the-",
      "spk": "Imani",
      "spkColor": "#80C9DC",
      "zh": ": 什么——"
    },
    {
      "en": ": The hell is that noise?",
      "spk": "Imani",
      "spkColor": "#80C9DC",
      "zh": ": 那是什么鬼声音？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did...",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ": 难道……"
    },
